new file mode 100644
index 0000000..b93b88f
--- /dev/null
+++ b/apps/materialcraft-cli/src/dobe_help.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+dobe-material: private headless CPU material engine
+
+Commands: snapshot, evaluate, maps, preview, info, commands, nodes, run, batch, new, cook, export, render.
+snapshot <input> reads editable state without cooking; it requires prior runtime admission.
+evaluate <input> <graph-index> cooks one admitted full graph with shared raster budgets and no save.
+maps <input> <graph-index> <options-json-file> <new-dir> exports admitted maps from one bounded cook.
+preview <input> <graph-index> <options-json-file> <new-dir> renders one bounded CPU preview.
+Native editable formats: .sbs and .mcraft. Portable material export: .mcmat.
+Use the Dobe CLI or product MCP for durable customer jobs.
+No editor connection, standalone MCP or network server is available.
+Automatic library discovery and external package/resource loading are disabled.
+The upstream converted function library is not embedded: redistribution rights are unverified.
+This private executable is not an untrusted-document sandbox or a release-qualified application.
